            <title>[LU-20224] kernel update [RHEL 10.1 6.12.0-124.55.1.el10_1]</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20224</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Security Fix(es) for kernel 6.12.0-124.55.1.el10_1:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: Linux kernel: Use-after-free in traffic control (act_ct) may lead to denial of service or privilege escalation (CVE-2026-23270)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: nfsd: fix heap overflow in NFSv4.0 LOCK replay cache (CVE-2026-31402)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: Linux kernel: Use-after-free in bonding driver leads to denial of service (CVE-2026-31419)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: crypto: algif_aead - Revert to operating out-of-place (CVE-2026-31431)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://access.redhat.com/errata/product/479/ver=/rhel---10/x86_64/RHSA-2026:13566" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://access.redhat.com/errata/product/479/ver=/rhel---10/x86_64/RHSA-2026:13566&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
